712.description:
This story begins with a shipwreck that lands the heroine, Scarlett, on a deserted island. Wait... Scarlett was on a boat, not a ship, and the island was actually inhabited, and in fact, this story is quite unlike other similar ones. Perhaps we should start at the beginning. So, by a twist of fate, a girl named Scarlett was washed up on a lonely island where a group of animals were unsuccessfully trying to farm.

This meeting turned out to be a boon for everyone, as Scarlett knows her way around farms and how to make a good profit from them. And the gamer will, of course, be the main assistant in this challenging but extremely exciting economic endeavor. Meet the continuation of the legendary series – "Farm Frenzy: All Aboard"!

Anyone familiar with the "Farm Frenzy" series knows how addictive it is to play. They're colorful and casual, with simple gameplay and lively music. The gist of the game is this: buy and feed animals, harvest them for various products, then produce more valuable products and sell them. With each new mission, the task becomes more challenging, with levels becoming longer, more complex, and thus even more exciting! Oh, and you have to do it fast. The new installment, "Farm Frenzy: All Aboard," takes players to a tropical island, where you'll encounter exotic animals. Remember, a fertile corner of the farm is always under attack from lazy villains, so be prepared to defend your farm from pesky pirates.

Game features:
- many exciting levels with a variety of tasks;
- bright cartoon graphics;
- cheerful musical and sound accompaniment;
- honorary awards and useful bonuses.
